        "original_id": "2985cfd2-e369-50eb-82eb-0156b0de23ad",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Rosario Dawson, Rachael Leigh Cook\n- Works: Josie and the Pussycats, Kids, She's All That, Into the West, Perception, Robot Chicken\n- Topics: film premise, acting career, voice acting\n\nFacts:\n- Rosario Dawson made her film debut in the 1995 teen drama \"Kids.\"\n- Rachael Leigh Cook was born on October 4, 1979, and she is an American actress, model, voice artist, and producer.\n- Rachael Leigh Cook is known for starring in the films \"She's All That\" (1999) and \"Josie and the Pussycats\" (2001).\n- The film \"Josie and the Pussycats\" is about a young all-female band that signs with a New York City record label and discovers that the company does not have the musicians' best interests at heart.\n- Rachael Leigh Cook is also known for the television series \"Into the West\" and \"Perception.\"\n- Rachael Leigh Cook voiced various characters in \"Robot Chicken\" and voiced Tifa Lockhart in the English version of \"Final Fantasy VII: Advent Children.\"",
